<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p>Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number_c}}}</p>

<p>Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},</p>

<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team. I'm sorry to hear about the service you experienced regarding <strong><em>&lt;details&gt;</em></strong> and wanted to thank you for bringing it to our attention.</p>

<p><strong>Lounge invitations</strong></p>

<p>As a token of our appreciation, I'd like to arrange a credit of <strong><em>&lt;number of passes&gt;</em></strong> complimentary lounge invitations to you. To use the invitations, you'll have to be a member of our Frequent Flyer program.</p>

<p>If you're not already a member, you can use this <a href="https://www.qantas.com/en-au/frequent-flyer/join/code/familyfree">link</a> to join free of charge. Please let us know your Frequent Flyer number by replying to this email so we can issue the invitations to your account.</p>

<p>Once we've received your Frequent Flyer number, we'll issue the invitations to your Frequent Flyer account. The passes should be available for use within 5–7 days and can be used when travelling with us in the future.</p>

<p>Thank you for your understanding—I hope that we can make you more comfortable prior to your next flight with us.</p>
</body>
